[patterns/application/micro-frontend/PTN-APP-MFE-015-testing-strategy-pattern.md#phase-4-accessibility-testing-week-4]

#### Phase 4: Accessibility Testing (Week 4)

1. **Install axe-core**

    ```bash
    npm install --save-dev @axe-core/react axe-playwright
    ```

2. **Setup Accessibility Tests**

    ```typescript
    // src/test/setup.ts
    import { configureAxe } from 'axe-core';

    if (process.env.NODE_ENV !== 'production') {
      const axe = require('@axe-core/react');
      axe.default(React, ReactDOM, 1000);
    }
    ```

3. **E2E Accessibility Test**

    ```typescript
    // e2e/accessibility.spec.ts
    import { test, expect } from '@playwright/test';
    import AxeBuilder from '@axe-core/playwright';

    test('claims page has no accessibility violations', async ({ page }) => {
      await page.goto('/claims');

      const accessibilityScanResults = await new AxeBuilder({ page })
        .withTags(['wcag2a', 'wcag2aa', 'wcag21a', 'wcag21aa'])
        .analyze();

      expect(accessibilityScanResults.violations).toEqual([]);
    });
    ```

